# scripts/opcount: `ratelimitbench bench bucket N` makes N takes of one
# token from a token bucket of 10 tokens and one back each 1ms, over 64
# keys, 10µs apart (ST1); the cost of one take is the slope between the
# two sizes. The control is hand Go with time.Time under a mutex; the floor
# keeps int64 nanoseconds.
unit take
sizes 200000 1200000
args bench bucket {n}
control benchmarks/ratelimit/testdata/control
floor benchmarks/ratelimit/testdata/floor
